&gt; Here’s a book_table tool. It takes a date, a time, and a party size. Call it.<p>Why not offer a simple form that humans and AI can use alike?<p><pre><code>    &lt;form action=book_table&gt;
      &lt;input type=date name=date&gt;
      &lt;input type=time name=time&gt;
      &lt;input type=number name=party_size&gt;
      &lt;input type=submit value=&quot;Book table&quot;&gt;
    &lt;&#x2F;form&gt;</code></pre>
